<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><bold>莱昂纳多堆</bold>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><ulink url="https://www.cs.utexas.edu/~EWD/transcriptions/EWD07xx/EWD796a.html">Dijkstra (1981) EWD796a</ulink>  </para>
