<entry thead="no"><para><bold>内省排序</bold>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><ulink url="https://doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-024X(199708)27:8&lt;983::AID-SPE117&gt;3.0.CO;2-%23">Musser (1997)</ulink>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>混合快速/堆/插入排序，C++ 标准库 sort 默认算法  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><bold>非加密哈希</bold>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><ulink url="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-eastlake-fnv-17">FNV-1a 草案</ulink>, <ulink url="https://github.com/aappleby/smhasher/wiki/MurmurHash3">MurmurHash3</ulink>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>高性能哈希表与布隆过滤器专用  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><bold>布隆过滤器</bold>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><ulink url="https://doi.org/10.1145/362686.362692">Bloom (1970)</ulink>, <ulink url="https://doi.org/10.1080/15427951.2004.10129096">Broder &amp; Mitzenmacher (2004)</ulink>, <ulink url="https://doi.org/10.1002/rsa.20208">Kirsch &amp; Mitzenmacher (2006)</ulink>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>双哈希优化的概率性集合成员查询结构，O(k) 插入/查询，支持最优参数 (m, k) 推导与误报率估算  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
</sect2>
